  "content": "# 第32题\n\n**题型**: 选择题\n\n**难度**: ★★★☆☆\n\n**分值**: 2分\n\n---\n\n## 题目内容\n\n32. The author raises three questions in Paragraph 2 mainly to________．\n\n## 选项\n\nA. A. present an assumption\n\nB. B. evaluate an argument\n\nC. C. highlight an experiment\n\nD. D. introduce an approach\n\n---\n\n## 参考答案\n\nD\n\n",
  "answer": "D",
  "analysis": "本题考查代词。both两者都；neither两者都不；either两者之一；all三者或以上都。根据‘两个’可知用both，故选D。"
